+ * Success retains HOST GPU/boot-slumber requests for later native CP startup;
+ * no HOST release on failure. Only our ACK24 is cleared after accepted OOB.
+ * No SQE/CP/RB writes or command/Metal claim. Output only on complete success;
+ * any started failure quarantines permanently without retry/cleanup.
